s":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D4k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc42ea11-1ddf-4c14-90ad-c2f393bc0c40","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"パーサーのテスト書いてるんだけど、ファイルをパーサーでデコードした 変数 と 手で作った変数比較すると、内部の struct の値が変わってるくさい…\n```C:\\home\\develop\\pfv\u0026gt;go test -v\n=== RUN   TestDecode\n=== RUN   TestDecode/data\n    decode_test.go:89: Decode() = \u0026amp;{Header:[PSDToolFavorites-v1] RootName:お気に入り FaviewMode:1 Items:[0xc000132600 0xc000132630]}, want \u0026amp;{Header:[PSDToolFavorites-v1] RootName:お気に入り FaviewMode:1 Items:[0xc0001325d0 0xc0001325d0]}\n--- FAIL: TestDecode (0.00s)\n    --- FAIL: TestDecode/data (0.00s)\nFAIL\nexit status 1\nFAIL    \u003chttp://github.com/raa0121/pfv|github.com/raa0121/pfv\u003e  0.038s```","ts":"1629019375.159500","edited":{"user":"U06ECBRTJ","ts":"1629019390.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"30ID"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3752b87c-8f3c-4229-8fe8-f500ff23c57d","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"go の test わからん","ts":"1629019053.157800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MzNg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"792dc4ab-a361-4eed-80f9-3fad12c4c355","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ただ、逆にそれらはFlaky に失敗でみえたりもあって、大変だ","ts":"1628991034.157200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QfRe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07AA3301-7CB1-4AED-85F6-1745468F7D7F","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"おっ、 :goodpoem: ","ts":"1628990835.156200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YpxV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"874e6aa4-927c-4445-9f41-30dad3d104f8","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"テストの順に依存してパスするようなテストあったりするのでこれではかどる。","ts":"1628990729.155600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mHX8K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b51ca4ae-b019-4d9a-bc14-108c7beaf4a7","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"そういえば Go のテストに -shuffle が入りますね。やっとか、という感じ。","ts":"1628990659.154300","edited":{"user":"U03C6TEAZ","ts":"1628990671.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":2,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","U011WJ8K6UU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nf2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4c79b7f-3362-4f4a-80d4-eb834cead71e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C0175T1HP70/p1628946019086300\u003e\nをパースするライブラリなんですが、\n```package pfv\n\nimport (\n\t\"strconv\"\n\t\"strings\"\n)\n\ntype Pfv struct {\n\tHeader string\n\tRootName string\n\tFaviewMode int\n\tItems []*Item\n}\n\ntype Item struct {\n\tName string\n\tElements []*Element\n}\n\ntype Element struct {\n\tPath string\n}\n\nfunc Decode(s string) *Pfv {\n\tpfv := \u0026amp;Pfv{}\n\tdata := strings.Split(s, \"\\n\")\n\tfor i, v := range data {\n\t\tif v == \"[PSDToolFavorites-v1]\" {\n\t\t\tpfv.Header = v\n\t\t}\n\t\tif strings.HasPrefix(v, \"root-name/\") {\n\t\t\tpfv.RootName = strings.Trim(v, \"root-name/\")\n\t\t}\n\t\tif strings.HasPrefix(v, \"faview-mode/\") {\n\t\t\ti, err := strconv.Atoi(strings.Trim(v, \"faview-mode/\"))\n\t\t\tif err != nil {\n\t\t\t\tpanic(err)\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tpfv.FaviewMode = i\n\t\t}\n\t\tif strings.HasPrefix(v, `//`) {\n\t\t\titem := \u0026amp;Item{\n\t\t\t\tName: strings.Trim(v, `//`),\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tfor j, vv := range data[i+1:] {\n\t\t\t\tif vv == \"\" {\n\t\t\t\t\ti += j\n\t\t\t\t\tbreak\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\te := \u0026amp;Element{ Path: vv }\n\t\t\t\titem.Elements = append(item.Elements, e)\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tpfv.Items = append(pfv.Items, item)\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\treturn pfv\n}```\nくらいのコードなんですよね…\nエラーチェックすらしてない…","ts":"1628955596.152400","thread_ts":"1628947995.149800","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cha0"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"5c04d03e-8bca-411d-a14d-37bb8b17d837","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"とある設定ファイルのパーサを書いたんですが、go 的には、 encoding 以下の API に合わせるのがスタンダードだったりしますかね？","ts":"1628947995.149800","thread_ts":"1628947995.149800","edited":{"user":"U06ECBRTJ","ts":"1628948038.000000"},"reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EbN4"}]}}]
